{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Tennis no Ouji-sama: Zenkoku Taikai-hen Semifinal","The National Tournament continues for Ryouma Echizen and the Seishun Academy Boys' Tennis Team as they face off against last year's semifinalist, Shitenhouji Middle School. As winners of the Kansai Regionals, Shitenhouji is one of the top contenders to win this year's tournament. What's more, each member of the Shitenhouji team has skills that are said to surpass their Seishun counterparts. Shitenhouji also has Kintarou Tooyama, another \"super rookie\" who rivals Ryouma in strength and technique. Seishun will have to push the limits of their abilities to stand a chance at defeating the Kansai champions in this East versus West matchup."],"ja":["テニスの王子様 全国大会篇 Semifinal",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":995,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":4053,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-2752","ids":{"shikimori":2752,"mal":2752,"anilist":2752,"kodik":"serial-41720"},"kodikIds":["serial-41720"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-41720":"2022-03-31T09:38:00Z"},"title":"Принц тенниса: Национальный турнир. Полуфинал","originalTitle":"Tennis no Ouji-sama: Zenkoku Taikai hen - Semifinal","alt":"Принц тенниса: Национальный турнир. Полуфинал / Prince of Tennis: The National Tournament Semifinals / Prince of Tennis OVA 2 / Prince of Tennis OVA Semifinal テニスの王子様 全国大会篇 Semifinal","description":"Теннисная команда Сейгаку продолжает своё выступление на Национальном первенстве. После триумфальной победы над старыми соперниками из Хётэй, ребят ждут новые, ещё более сильные игроки. Их соперник определится в четвертьфинальном матче между старыми знакомыми из Фудоминэ и представителями Осаки — Ситэнходзи. Новые игроки, новые вершины мастерства, новые вызовы!","year":2007,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Спорт"],"rating":7.87,"popularity":7134,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[995,4053],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2752/d9e9b16b1798201269874057370e7d80.jpeg","widt